      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm, have the same issue with an AMD RX 6800XT\nI have heard people confirm htis same issue already with: RX 5700, 6700XT and 6800. For now I have only seen this issue appear in twitch streams.\nAfter asking a few people it looks like this issue occues for everyone with an RDNA 2 based GPU. Another person, having an RX 470 said they don't have this issue. Can not tell if it is a coincidence or shows it really only affects RDNA2 GPUs. This issue also persisted already before the engine upgrade.\nA friend of mine did a more detailed write up here: https://github.com/RenderHeads/UnityPlugin-AVProVideo/issues/697#issuecomment-898686943\nThe author of this plugin is offering help on a level  only a VRChat dev could support him from what it looks like.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
