      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I always have the same issue since I joined VR Chat a few months ago. Did not change when I got a completely new PC... I have an AMD 6700 XT GPU. Everything works fine, audio as you said above, too. Only the light and the video are always having issues for me. Funny enough, it does not matter which party/world I was joining, it appeared on all of those.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
