      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just wanted to add to this: I was just reminded that the 5700 is RDNA1 and not RDNA2. So it looks like this issue affects all RDNA architectures and might even affect future generations. This would basically cause issues for everyone getting a newer graphics card from one of the current main vandors if they join events like parties or community events relying on twitch as a source for a stream.\nI also found out, that the issue only occures if there are other people in the same instance. If I am alone it seams not to happen. Not sure if this  information was already in the github report, I just wanted to leave it here as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
