      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also get this bug with some streams.  Apparently it's a bug in  Windows Media Foundation related to low latency mode.  Allowing the VRC client to toggle low latency mode off or to toggle off hardware decoding could be possible workarounds.\n\nhttps://github.com/RenderHeads/UnityPlugin-AVProVideo/issues/697\n\nhttps://github.com/RenderHeads/UnityPlugin-AVProVideo/issues/940",
      "viewerReactions": null,
